                  "text": "Sef 2:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nami nitafanya Raba kuwa banda la ngamia, na wana wa Amoni kuwa mahali pa kulaza makundi; nanyi mtajua ya kuwa mimi ndimi BWANA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maana Bwana MUNGU asema hivi; Kwa sababu umepiga makofi, na kupiga mshindo kwa miguu yako, na kufurahi juu ya nchi ya Israeli, jeuri yote ya roho yako; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "basi, tazama, nimenyosha mkono wangu juu yako, nami nitakutoa uwe mateka ya mataifa; nami nitakukatilia mbali na makabila ya watu, nami nitakuangamiza, usiwe katika nchi hizo; nitakukomesha; nawe utajua ya kuwa mimi ndimi BWANA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
